{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">天氣不穩，天文台上午一度發出黃色暴雨警告。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">黃雨警告是在上午8時40分生效，持續3個小時，期間灣仔、東區、南區、離島區，以及西貢和觀塘雨量較多。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.HKO-0930.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026ZuTl9MnNb31786672091.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.HKO-0930.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">天文台指，與高空擾動及西南氣流相關的強雷雨帶，正影響廣東及南海北部。預測今日大致多雲，間中有驟雨及強烈狂風雷暴，雨勢有時頗大。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.HKO 1030 UPD1100.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20266in7XKsLrE1786678360.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.HKO 1030 UPD1100.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-14T04:19:32.696120+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}